WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.080
Mother: When I was little, our red barn was my castle.

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:08.660
Child: Did it have a dragon?

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:11.200
Mother: It does now.

00:00:15.617 --> 00:00:18.217
[Soft chime]

00:00:18.317 --> 00:00:21.117
The Chandelier: You've got ten minutes before you need to leave for the movie.

00:00:23.697 --> 00:00:24.637
Child: Can the dragon come?

00:00:26.097 --> 00:00:27.477
Mother: Only if it shares the popcorn.
